  en: >-
    We are actively recruiting for the 2026 Fall intake, and we welcome students from physics,
    chemistry, materials science and electrical engineering.
  zhHant: 我們正積極招收 2026 年秋季入學的學生，歡迎物理、化學、材料科學與電機工程背景的同學加入。
openings:
  - title:
      en: Master's students
      zhHant: 碩士班學生
    detail:
      en: >-
        Through the NTU GIPO admissions process. Projects are available across materials synthesis,
