      zhHant: 請透過臺大光電所招生管道申請。研究題目涵蓋材料合成、超快光譜與元件製作。
    open: true
  - title:
      en: Undergraduate researchers
      zhHant: 大學部專題生
    detail:
      en: >-
        We take a small number of undergraduate project students each year. No prior research
        experience is expected — curiosity and consistency matter more.
      zhHant: 我們每年招收少數大學部專題生。不要求先備研究經驗，好奇心與持續投入更為重要。
    open: true
  - title:
      en: Postdoctoral researchers
      zhHant: 博士後研究員
    detail:
      en: >-
        If you are interested, please email Prof. Huang with your CV and a short description of
        your research interests.
      zhHant: 有興趣者，請以電子郵件寄送履歷與簡短的研究興趣說明予黃教授。
    open: true
---
You do not need to already know everything on this site. Most people join us strong in one of
chemistry, physics or engineering and pick up the other two as they go — that is the normal path
here, not a shortfall.

When you write, it helps to say what you have enjoyed working on and why, rather than listing
courses. A short, specific email is better than a long, general one.
